+## Appendix: Implementation Details
+
+### Supervisor Health Check Logic
+
+```python
+# ui/supervisor.py
+async def _healthcheck_loop():
+    """Monitor Agent health and restart on failure."""
+    while True:
+        try:
+            await httpx.get(f"http://127.0.0.1:{AGENT_PORT}/health", timeout=5)
+            await httpx.get(f"http://127.0.0.1:{AGENT_PORT}/debug/routes", 
+                          follow_redirects=False)  # Expect 401 (auth required)
+            _agent_routes_ready = True
+        except Exception:
+            _agent_routes_ready = False
+        
+        if not _agent_routes_ready:
+            await restart_agent()
+        
+        await asyncio.sleep(HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL)  # 3 seconds
+```
+
+### Process Spawning
+
+```python
+# ui/supervisor.py
+async def start():
+    """Spawn Agent subprocess."""
+    process = await asyncio.create_subprocess_exec(
+        sys.executable, "-m", "uvicorn", "agent.main:app",
+        "--host", host,
+        "--port", str(AGENT_PORT),
+        stdout=asyncio.subprocess.PIPE,
+        stderr=asyncio.subprocess.PIPE,
+    )
+    self._process = process
+```
+
+### Shared Configuration
+
+Both processes share configuration via `shared/config.py`:
+
+```python
+# shared/config.py
+class Settings(BaseSettings):
+    UI_PORT: int = 8000
+    AGENT_PORT: int = 8001
+    BIND_HOST: str = "127.0.0.1"
+    DEEPSEEK_API_KEY: str = ""
+    LM_STUDIO_BASE_URL: str = "http://localhost:1234/v1"
+```
